{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2021-11-05 16:30:00', 'title': 'AEP HIGHLIGHTS PLANNED CAPITAL INVESTMENTS IN RENEWABLES AND ENERGY GRID, REAFFIRMS OPERATING EARNINGS GROWTH RATE OF 5% TO 7%', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, OHIO , NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) PLANS TO INVEST IN ITS REGULATED BUSINESSES AND RENEWABLE GENERATION AS IT CONTINUES TO TRANSFORM AND BUILD A CLEANER, MORE MODERN ENERGY SYSTEM. THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED ITS 2022 OPERATING EARNINGS (EARNINGS EXCLUDING SPECIAL ITEMS) GUIDANCE RANGE OF $4.85 TO $5.05 PER SHARE, REFLECTING ITS PROJECTED ANNUAL OPERATING EARNINGS GROWTH RATE OF 5% TO 7%.'}